  "summary": "Immutable worker-job revisions bind every admitted lane end to end. Implementation v27 and break-fix v24 require a typed owner/case/control acceptance oracle, with closed source and authority joins and retained readiness evidence. Every predicate retains executable coverage. Main may add Review-judged cases without native controls; recorded executable obligations cannot become judged cases. Definitions have one canonical source and no historical pins. Local acceptance holds the step without delivery; whole-work delivery keeps parent admission and integration evidence. Superseded-contract revisions are not ready. Each launch carries its own scope and subject bindings without attempt-count or convergence walls.",
